+/* ==========================================================================
+ * NVSHMEM_IBGDA_FT (research, default off): host side of the fault-tolerance
+ * path. See harness/gpu-initiated/nvshmem_ft/DESIGN.md.
+ *
+ *   NVSHMEM_IBGDA_FT=1              device classification + host mailbox + watcher, and the
+ *                                   recovery API below (GPU NIC handler only).
+ *   NVSHMEM_IBGDA_FT_POLL_US=<us>   watcher poll period (default 50).
+ *   NVSHMEM_IBGDA_FT_CAPTURE=exit   diagnostic: classify only the CQE that ends the wait (stock
+ *                                   position), not the slot contents seen while spinning.
+ *   NVSHMEM_IBGDA_FT_DRAIN_MS=<ms>  Prepare: bound on the wait for the NIC to flush every posted
+ *                                   WQE after the QP is in ERR (default 1000).
+ *   NVSHMEM_IBGDA_FT_QUIET=1        do not log records (overhead runs).
